{"title":"At the Supermarket","puid":"c-eng-2-gb/rvo08b","path":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-07-food-and-drink/block-01-review/level-03","type":"normal","keyboardLayout":"standardNATENG","voiceLang":"en","voice":"f3_2025","instruction":{"voice":"m2_2025","speaker":true},"trainers":[{"trainer":"content","textAlign":"left","design":"dialogue","instruction":"Read.","atoms":[{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-07-food-and-drink/block-01-review/lsg/dairysec.lsg"},{"text":"Ok, I am at the dairy section now. Let me check my list.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f10_chirp","position":"left","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/adults/salma.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"I need some milk. I want to make milkshakes for my friends this weekend. I also need some butter. I am making a cake tomorrow, so I need quite a lot.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f10_chirp","position":"left","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/adults/salma.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"I also need some cheese. I am making a pasta dish tonight. And I will grab a chocolate bar from the next aisle for a snack later.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f10_chirp","position":"left","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/adults/salma.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"}]},{"trainer":"table","gapMode":"buttons","shuffleButtons":false,"instruction":{"text":"Fill in the gaps."},"layout":"a1 b1\na2 b2\na3 b3\na4 b4","atoms":[{"id":"a1","b":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-07-food-and-drink/block-01-review/lsg/03/milk2.lsg"}},{"id":"b1","b":"I need ((a an ++some)) milk."},{"id":"a2","b":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-07-food-and-drink/block-01-review/lsg/03/butter.lsg"}},{"id":"b2","b":"I need ((a an ++some)) butter."},{"id":"a3","b":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-07-food-and-drink/block-01-review/lsg/03/ice_cream.lsg"}},{"id":"b3","b":"I will grab ((++a an some)) chocolate bar. "},{"id":"a4","b":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-07-food-and-drink/block-01-review/lsg/03/cheese.lsg"}},{"id":"b4","b":"I want ((a an ++some)) cheese."}]},{"trainer":"content","textAlign":"left","design":"dialogue","instruction":"Read.","atoms":[{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-07-food-and-drink/block-01-review/lsg/03/vegies.lsg"},{"text":"Now let me find the fruit and vegetables. I need an apple, a lemon, an onion and a cucumber. They all look so fresh today!","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f10_chirp","position":"left","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/adults/salma.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"}]},{"trainer":"table","gapMode":"buttons","shuffleButtons":false,"instruction":{"text":"Fill in the gaps."},"layout":"a1 b1\na2 b2\na3 b3\na4 b4","atoms":[{"id":"a1","b":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-07-food-and-drink/block-01-review/lsg/03/apple2.lsg"}},{"id":"b1","b":"I want ((a ++an some)) apple."},{"id":"a2","b":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-07-food-and-drink/block-01-review/lsg/03/lemon.lsg"}},{"id":"b2","b":"I want ((++a an some)) lemon."},{"id":"a3","b":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-07-food-and-drink/block-01-review/lsg/onion.lsg"}},{"id":"b3","b":"I need ((a ++an some )) onion."},{"id":"a4","b":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-07-food-and-drink/block-01-review/lsg/cucumber.lsg"}},{"id":"b4","b":"I need ((++a an some)) cucumber."}]},{"trainer":"content","textAlign":"left","design":"dialogue","instruction":"Read.","atoms":[{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-07-food-and-drink/block-01-review/lsg/03/store.lsg"},{"text":"Excuse me, where can I find flour and sugar?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f10_chirp","position":"left","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/adults/salma.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"You can find them in aisle five.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"m1_chirp","position":"right","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-07-food-and-drink/block-01-review/lsg/worker.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"Great, thank you! I also want a doughnut. Where can I find that?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f10_chirp","position":"left","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2